      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">105 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Build it yourself: 90 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine-coding case study</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 31 of the LLD question list</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Train Ticket Booking (IRCTC)</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A movie seat is sold once per show. A train berth is sold once per <b>stretch of track</b>: Delhi to Gwalior to one person, Gwalior to Nagpur to another. This page builds the reservation core that Adobe, Amazon, Walmart and Zepto ask for: per-segment availability with bitmasks, confirmed / RAC / waitlist allocation, automatic promotion when someone cancels, and a tatkal window where a hundred threads fight for two berths at 10:00:00. Java, Python and C++14 code all run.</p>\n"
  },
